Soft RTC

This repository contains modifications and experiment scripts for Soft RTC.

Portions of the simulator training and evaluation code are derived from the
public RTC Kinetix code released by Physical Intelligence for:

- Real-Time Execution of Action Chunking Flow Policies
- Training-Time Action Conditioning for Efficient Real-Time Chunking

The upstream RTC Kinetix code is distributed under the MIT License. The original
copyright and license text are retained in LICENSE.

The Soft RTC modifications include token-wise action-prior weighting, delay
scaled / fixed / offset soft-conditioning windows, training-time Soft RTC
fine-tuning scripts, evaluation scripts, ablation scripts, timing scripts, and
paper-summary figure/table generation utilities.

This release does not redistribute OpenPI real-robot runtime code. If
OpenPI-derived robot deployment code is added in a future release, retain the
OpenPI Apache-2.0 license notices and mark modified files accordingly.
